</text><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"75.884645\" y2=\"157.940694\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"79.751807\" y2=\"149.004210\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"84.172465\" y2=\"140.328181\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"89.129172\" y2=\"131.946847\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"94.602366\" y2=\"123.893286\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"100.570447\" y2=\"116.199282\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"107.009863\" y2=\"108.895199\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"113.895199\" y2=\"102.009863\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"121.199282\" y2=\"95.570447\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"128.893286\" y2=\"89.602366\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"113.023\" y=\"72.759\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\">90</text><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"136.946847\" y2=\"84.129172\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"145.328181\" y2=\"79.172465\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"154.004210\" y2=\"74.751807\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"162.940694\" y2=\"70.884645\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"172.102366\" y2=\"67.586240\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"181.453067\" y2=\"64.869610\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"190.955896\" y2=\"62.745476\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"200.573349\" y2=\"61.222221\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"210.267469\" y2=\"60.305857\" stroke=\"#315b50\" stroke-width=\".55\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\">100等扇區空白模板</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"421\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\">頂端0起，順時針數；每格占1%</text></g></svg><figcaption>完整圓由100個等大扇區組成，每格1%；上方為0界線，每10格有較粗界線和累計數標記，可由頂端順時針連續著色。</figcaption></figure></div>",
      "id": "g6s2-mathematics-10-s03"
